<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <link rel="icon" type="png" href="favicon.png">
  <title>I HATE OCS</title>
  <style>
    /* Retro 2009-style styling — updated: full-screen wallpaper, light-yellow panel, blue accents */
    body {
      background: url('background.png') no-repeat center center fixed;
      background-size: cover;
      color:#111;
      font-family: 'Comic Sans MS','Trebuchet MS', Arial, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
    }
    .overlay {
      position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(255,255,240,0.35); pointer-events:none;
      mix-blend-mode:soft-light;
    }
    .container { width:820px; margin:48px auto; background:#fff8c4; border:4px solid #1900ff; padding:22px; box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); color:#111; position:relative; margin-left: 220px; }
    .sidebar {
      position: fixed;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 200px;
      height: 100%;
      background: #fff8c4;
      border-right: 4px solid #1900ff;
      padding: 22px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      z-index: 10;
    }
    .sidebar ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .sidebar li {
      margin: 10px 0;
    }
    .sidebar a {
      color: #1900ff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    .header { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:18px; }
    .header img { width:96px; height:96px; object-fit:contain; border:3px solid #3700ff; background:rgb(255, 255, 255); }
    .title { font-size:56px; color:#1900ff; text-shadow:2px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); line-height:1; }
    .subtitle { font-size:14px; color:#333; margin-top:6px; }
    /* .big-pic removed to eliminate empty gap at top */
    .DESCRIPTION { text-align:left; background:rgb(255, 255, 255); padding:12px; border:3px dashed #1900ff; color:#111; }
    .DESCRIPTION h2 { text-align:center; color:#1900ff; font-size:34px; margin:0 0 10px; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .DESCRIPTION ul { margin:0; padding-left:20px; color:#222; }
    .info-box { margin:16px 0; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9); padding:12px; border:3px solid #e6d88a; color:#111; box-sizing:border-box; }
    .info-box h3 { margin:0 0 6px 0; color:#1900ff; }
    .info-box p { margin:0; }
    .footer { margin-top:12px; font-size:12px; color:#1900ff; }
    a { color:#0044cc; }
    /* reduce heavy black areas for a lighter vintage vibe */
    body, .container, .big-pic { transition:all 180ms ease; }
    .oc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .oc-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); padding: 10px; border: 3px solid #e6d88a; text-decoration: none; color: #111; transition: transform 0.2s; }
    .oc-item:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }
    .oc-item img { width: 100px; height: 100px; object-fit: cover; border: 2px solid #1900ff; }
    .oc-item p { margin: 5px 0 0; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; }
    .section-box { margin: 20px 0; }
    .section-box h2 { color: #1900ff; text-align: center; }
    .gallery { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 10px; }
    .gallery-thumb img { width: 100%; height: auto; border: 2px solid #1900ff; }
    .updates { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
    .updates li { margin: 5px 0; }
    .comics-link { margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
    .comics-rect { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); padding: 20px; border: 3px solid #e6d88a; display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; color: #111; }
    .comics-rect h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #1900ff; }
    .comics-rect p { margin: 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="sidebar">
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="ocs-lore.html">OCs Lore</a></li>
      <li><a href="comics.html">Comics</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <img src="distantstar-sketch.gif" alt="Princess Luz" />
      <div>
        <div class="title">I HATE OCS</div>
        <div class="subtitle">This site is made to showcase my OCs, art and edits. All OCs belong to me. Some stuff might be triggering to some people, viewer discretion is advised.</div>
      </div>
      <img src="distantstar-sketch.gif" alt="right gif" />
    </div>

    <div class="big-pic" role="img" aria-label="Princess Luz.png"></div>

    <div class="DESCRIPTION">
      <h2>DESCRIPTION</h2>
      <ul>
    This website is a personal archive created to showcase my ocs,
      their lore, timelines, and related material.<br>
      Viewer discretion is advised.
      </ul>
    </div>

    <section id="oc-grid" class="section-box">
      <h2>OCs</h2>
      <div class="oc-grid">
        <a href="sel.html" class="oc-item">
          <img src="Sel.png" alt="Sel">
          <p>Sel</p>
        </a>
        <a href="riz.html" class="oc-item">
          <img src="Riz.png" alt="Riz">
          <p>Riz</p>
        </a>
        <a href="sel2.html" class="oc-item">
          <img src="Seel.png" alt="Seel">
          <p>Sel</p>
        </a>
        <a href="s3l.html" class="oc-item">
          <img src="S3L.png" alt="S3L">
          <p>S3L</p>
        </a>
        <a href="xyn.html" class="oc-item">
          <img src="Xyn.png" alt="Xyn">
          <p>Xyn</p>
        </a>
        <a href="moken.html" class="oc-item">
          <img src="Moken.png" alt="Moken">
          <p>Moken</p>
        </a>
        <a href="lynz.html" class="oc-item">
          <img src="LynZ.png" alt="LynZ">
          <p>LynZ</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="comics-link">
      <a href="comics.html">
        <div class="comics-rect">
          <h3>Comics</h3>
          <p>Click here to see the comics</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="info-box">
      <h2>UPDATES</h2>
      <ul class="updates">
        <li><b>06/27/2016</b> – Added LynZ's lore and pic and a new comic. </li>
        <li><b>05/08/2016</b> – Changed the layout and added a comic, also made it so you can click on a comic to see it in full size. </li>
        <li><b>04/22/2016</b> – added Moken's lore and pic. </li>
        <li><b>03/27/2016</b> – Added a comic ("Sel during the summer"); added Xyn, and S3L's lore and pics. </li>
        <li><b>09/14/2010</b> – Nothing happened that day idk why Im updating this</li>
        <li><b>04/15/2010</b> – added some gifs and stuff</li>
        <li><b>01/01/2010</b> – happy new year! sorry for having been inactive...</li>
        <li><b>09/18/2008</b> – fixed broken images</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <marquee behavior="scroll" direction="left">If you genuinely think this website or my ocs are good, please seek help.</marquee>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>